    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d815">

                <pb facs="0873" n="761" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg761"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul Olivares to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d815-f1"/></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-08-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Olivares reports that Gens. Juan Estrada and Emiliano Chamorro arrived at
                    Nicaragua at 6 o’clock p.m. to-day.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d815-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d815-f1-content">
                <p>Transmitted through the American Legation at Tegucigalpa.</p>
            </note>
